- motivation: `stmap45` showed that enforcing pressure agreement in the admission rule changed final QoR and recovered some `syn2` area, but it also worsened delay relative to `stmap44`. The next diagnostic question was whether only the tightest, highest-gain moderate soft seeds should bypass the pressure-agreement gate while broad moderate penalty candidates stay protected.
